export anchor TestOrder:
    description:
        Problems are found before anything costly. The configuration is read
        first, then the flags are checked against the declaration, then the
        test settings, then the tag expression is parsed, then the project is
        compiled and the tests collected and selected.
        Only then is the tool needed: `--list` stops there, so listing works
        without the tool installed, and a run checks the tool is on PATH
        before launching it for any test.
